      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Flag used to change the behavior of FillResponse.Builder.disableAutofill(long)— when this flag is passed to Builder.setFlags(int), autofill is disabled only for the activiy that generated the FillRequest, not the whole app.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/service/autofill/FillResponse#FLAG_DISABLE_ACTIVITY_ONLY" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.service.autofill.FillResponse.FLAG_DISABLE_ACTIVITY_ONLY</code>.</a></format></para>
